        "cooked": "<p>Hello! I discovered the Letters Page podcast about a week ago. Since then I have listened to about fifteen episodes, downloaded the phone game, bought the card game, and ordered the RPG Starter Set. This is a crazy cool world that I'm absolutely falling in love with. But, I don't want to be a poseur.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>So, what do I need to do next to become a part of this community, participate in the upcoming shenanigans, and be the best fan I can be?</p>\n<p>Also, here's a doodle of Haka, because he's my favorite and I hope you'll find it endearing.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/cc66b42ee5b7cc738405b1b9edbbc2d528267127.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/cc66b42ee5b7cc738405b1b9edbbc2d528267127\" title=\"IMG_0519.JPG\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cc66b42ee5b7cc738405b1b9edbbc2d528267127_2_374x499.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_0519.JPG\" data-base62-sha1=\"tadrEaRgHlAxPNrda7V6oQirAML\" width=\"374\" height=\"499\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cc66b42ee5b7cc738405b1b9edbbc2d528267127_2_374x499.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cc66b42ee5b7cc738405b1b9edbbc2d528267127_2_561x748.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cc66b42ee5b7cc738405b1b9edbbc2d528267127_2_748x998.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cc66b42ee5b7cc738405b1b9edbbc2d528267127_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">IMG_0519.JPG</span><span class=\"informations\">1452×1936 402 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=